name: Modify Files
description: Let an LLM agent edit the cell's files to a task you describe. One input cell is edited in
  place; a collapsed cell of many candidates fans out — one edit per candidate, each an option folder. Guided
  by the modify-files skill.
tags:
- modify-files
prompt: Apply the task pinned in the system prompt to this cell's files with the modify-files skill, dispatching
  on the input shape — one cell edited in place, or one edited option folder per candidate.
settings:
  agent-config.set_yaml:
    surface: annotation
    session: oneshot
    backend: pydantic-ai
    system_prompt: ''
    mcp: 'off'
    approvals: auto
    selected_file_first: false
folders:
- _skills
accounts: {}
permissions:
  docker: none
  internet: full
  commands: deny
packages: {}
